claude: true
prompt: >
  You are working the WWW::VastAI repository (a Moo client for the Vast.ai REST
  APIs). Read .claude/rules/www-vastai-rules.md, then pick the next actionable
  ticket from the local karr board and drive it to review. Delegate
  behavior-relevant code to the www-vastai-worker agent; run pre-release audits
  through www-vastai-release-checker. Never run `dzil release` and never set
  VAST_LIVE_ALLOW_COST=1. Stop when nothing actionable remains.
